oxoffice is a friendly fork of rdocx and rpptx by Atul Sharma (tensorbee)
and contributors: https://github.com/tensorbee/rdocx

It starts from rdocx v0.17.0 and rpptx v0.15.0
(tensorbee/rdocx eb980e94c8ae1f8b42612f918482bc627e0141a0), plus
tensorbee/rdocx pull requests #448 to #454
(hadim/rdocx 2543cf635e3de3e5ce53dfd7ae83f65e2b6c9d23).

